y that stays private. Public entry points lead into isolated workloads, every model call passes one governed gateway, and the whole thing is Terraform, tested before it ever touches a subscription." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;fontColor=#475569;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="75" y="86" width="2200" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="people" value='&lt;b style="font-size:18px;color:#0F172A"&gt;Desktop and Android app&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:13px;color:#475569"&gt;Local engine syncs finished&lt;br&gt;meetings: PUT /v1/sync&lt;/span&gt;' style="shape=label;rounded=1;arcSize=9;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=3;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/Users.svg;imageAlign=center;imageVerticalAlign=top;imageWidth=50;imageHeight=50;verticalAlign=bottom;spacingBottom=10;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="130" y="190" width="300" height="145" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="afd" value='&lt;b style="font-size:18px;color:#0F172A"&gt;Front Door Premium + WAF&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:13px;color:#475569"&gt;Managed rules · bots · rate limit&lt;br&gt;Custom domain · standby origin&lt;/span&gt;' style="shape=label;rounded=1;arcSize=9;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=3;image=img/lib/azure2/networking/Front_Doors.svg;imageAlign=center;imageVerticalAlign=top;imageWidth=50;imageHeight=50;verticalAlign=bottom;spacingBottom=10;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="190" width="300" height="145" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="apim" value='&lt;b style="font-size:18px;color:#0F172A"&gt;API Management&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:13px;color:#475569"&gt;JWT check · rate limit · request id&lt;br&gt;3 zones · second region&lt;/span&gt;' 