&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:13px;color:#475569"&gt;EU regions only&lt;br&gt;Security benchmark&lt;/span&gt;' style="shape=label;rounded=1;arcSize=9;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=3;image=img/lib/azure2/management_governance/Policy.svg;imageAlign=center;imageVerticalAlign=top;imageWidth=50;imageHeight=50;verticalAlign=bottom;spacingBottom=10;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1370" y="1495" width="290" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value='&lt;b style="font-size:18px;color:#0F172A"&gt;Budget and locks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:13px;color:#475569"&gt;Cost alerts&lt;br&gt;Delete lock on the data&lt;/span&gt;' style="shape=label;rounded=1;arcSize=9;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=3;image=img/lib/azure2/general/Cost_Budgets.svg;imageAlign=center;imageVerticalAlign=top;imageWidth=50;imageHeight=50;verticalAlign=bottom;spacingBottom=10;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1690" y="1495" width="290" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value='&lt;b style="font-size:18px;color:#0F172A"&gt;Terraform · GitHub OIDC&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:13px;color:#475569"&gt;Deploy without stored keys&lt;br&gt;Plan tests, CI image scan&lt;/span&gt;' style="shape=label;rounded=1;arcSize=9;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=3;image=img/lib/azure2/devops/Azure_DevOps.svg;imageAlign=center;imageVerticalAlign=top;imageWidth=50;imageHeight=50;verticalAlign=bottom;spacingBottom=10;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2010" y="1495" width="290" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c28" value='&lt;b style="font-size:22px;color:#16A34A"&gt;Isolated by design&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:13px;color:#475569"&gt;Forced row level security, checked&lt;br&gt;by preflight; owner filter on search&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=9;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=3;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="1765" width="345" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c29" value='&lt;b style="font-size:22px;color:#16A34A"&gt;No long-lived credentials&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:13px;color:#475569"&gt;A managed identity per workload,&lt;br&gt;OIDC for deploys, secrets in Key Vault&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=9;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=3;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="1765" width="345" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c30" value='&lt;b style="font-size:22px;color:#EA580C"&gt;Never trust the model&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:13px;color:#475569"&gt;Every citation re-checked against&lt;br&gt;the transcript; schemas are strict&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=9;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#EA580C;strokeWidth=3;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="1765" width="345" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c31" value='&lt;b style="font-size:22px;color:#7C3AED"&gt;Provable audit trail&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:13px;color:#475569"&gt;Append-only log, hash chain,&lt;br&gt;write-once archive, GDPR export and erase&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=9;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=3;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1210" y="1765" width="345" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c32" value='&lt;b style="font-size:22px;color:#2563EB"&gt;Fails soft&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:13px;color:#475569"&gt;Bulkheads, breakers, retries,&lt;br&gt;load shedding, sources-only fallback&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=9;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=3;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1580" y="1765" width="345" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c33" value='&lt;b style="font-size:22px;color:#334155"&gt;Tested offline&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:13px;color:#475569"&gt;680 backend tests on real PostgreSQL,&lt;br&gt;112 app tests, 9 Terraform plan tests&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=9;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=3;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1950" y="1765" width="345" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c34" value="Blue: public HTTPS  ·  Orange: governed model path  ·  Dark: private traffic  ·  Green dashed: identity check  ·  Purple dashed: scheduled jobs  ·  Grey dashed: replication" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontColor=#475569;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="75" y="1955" width="2250" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c36" value="1" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2563EB;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="543" y="245" width="34" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c38" value="2" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2563EB;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1003" y="245" width="34" height="34" 